OL,3,CTeenager dies at Kendal Calling music
OL,4,Cfestival
OL,6,FA 17-year-old girl has died at Kendal
OL,7,FCalling music festival.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,10,Fevent, which is held at Lowther Deer
OL,11,FPark, shortly after 2am today, 2
OL,12,FAugust.
OL,14,FCPR was administered on site but the
OL,15,F17-year-old girl was pronounced dead
OL,16,Fat the scene.
OL,18,FCumbria Police say her family have
OL,19,Fbeen informed and are being supported
OL,20,Fby specialist officers.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/4
