OL,3,CTeenager dies at Kendal Calling music
OL,4,Cfestival
OL,6,FIn a statement, a spokesperson for
OL,7,FKendal Calling, said: "The team at
OL,8,FKendal Calling are deeply saddened by
OL,9,Fthe passing of a festival attendee in
OL,10,Fthe early hours of Sunday morning
OL,11,Ffollowing a medical episode.
OL,13,F"As soon as the individual became
OL,14,Funwell, they were immediately attended
OL,15,Fto by our on-site security and medical
OL,16,Fteams. Paramedics and medical
OL,17,Fpersonnel provided emergency care at
OL,18,Fthe scene and did everything they
OL,19,Fcould to help.
OL,26,@oD@WOU
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/4
