CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1785928779
OL,3,CTeenager dies at Kendal Calling music
OL,4,Cfestival
OL,6,F"We extend our deepest sympathies to
OL,7,Fthe individual's family, friends and
OL,8,Floved ones at this incredibly
OL,9,Fdifficult time. We are supporting the
OL,10,Frelevant authorities and will continue
OL,11,Fto assist them with their
OL,12,Finvestigation."
OL,14,FEnquiries into the circumstances
OL,15,Fsurrounding her death are ongoing and
OL,16,Fofficers are urging anyone who was in
OL,17,Fthe area of the 'Calling Out' tent and
OL,18,Fthe Big Wheel within the site at
OL,19,Faround 2am to contact police.
OL,26,@tD@OO]
